<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA A AND SOUTH AFRICA DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA A AND SOUTH AFRICA DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>NAGPUR, India 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa and India A drew their three-day game on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 384-5 dec and 495-3. India A 340.</p>
</text>
